# LIMPET: the demo player plays the whole game from the title with button
# presses: through the hub's gates, every deck, the Turncoat (Beacon) and the
# Dreadnought (Saucer), to the ending and back to the station.
game limpet
wait 5
botuntil state == 2 600
expect level == 29
botuntil cleared >= 4 30000
botuntil cleared >= 9 30000
botuntil turncoat == 1 40000
expect goals == 1
botuntil cleared >= 22 60000
botuntil dread == 1 60000
expect goals == 3
expect cleared == 26
botuntil state == 6 4000
botuntil state == 2 4000
expect level == 29
expect save_wins == 1
